// Car data for the Supercar Legends app.
//
// Each row: [name, maker, year, country, type, engine, bhp, topMph, zeroTo62, weightKg, numberBuilt,
//            description, fact 1, fact 2, big clue, wikipedia page]
//   year:       the year the car was launched or first raced
//   bhp, topMph, zeroTo62 (seconds), weightKg: the maker's claimed figures where there are any,
//               otherwise figures from Wikipedia or a respected magazine test. null means not known or not announced.
//   numberBuilt: null when the car is still being made, or when nobody agrees on a number.
//   weightKg:   sources mix "dry" weight (no fuel or oil) and kerb weight, so treat it as a guide.
//   wikipedia page: where tools/fetch_images.py looks for a free photo (the credit goes in credits.js).
//
// Every number was checked on 11 October 2026 against the car's English and German Wikipedia articles,
// and where those did not give it, against a web search. No car-maker logos are used anywhere in the app.

